n and [[Lee Sang-woo]] were selected as new models for [[Lotte Chilsung|Lotte Chilsung Beverage]]'s "Let's-B Cafe Time".<ref>{{Cite web|script-title=ko:롯데칠성음료 '레쓰비 카페타임' 새 모델에 씨스타와 이상우|trans-title=Sistar and Lee Sang-woo as new models for Lotte Chilsung Beverage's 'Let's-B Cafe Time'|url=http://www.sportsworldi.com/newsView/20121205025043|via=[[Naver]]|publisher=sportsworldi.com|language=ko|last=Ryu|first=Geun-won|work=롯데칠성음료 "레쓰비 카페타임" 새 모델에 씨스타와 이상우 스포츠월드 |date=December 5, 2012|access-date=November 24, 2022|archive-date=November 24, 2022|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221124064832/http://www.sportsworldi.com/newsView/20121205025043|url-status=live}}</ref>

