ased tracksuits for the 2015 photoshoot of the same brand.<ref>{{Cite web|script-title=ko:씨스타, 효린-소유 완벽 몸매 화보 공개|trans-title=SISTAR, Hyolyn and Soyou reveal perfect body pictorial|url=http://news.kmib.co.kr/article/view.asp?arcid=0009220631&code=61181511&cp=nv|via=[[Naver]]|publisher=[[Kukmin Ilbo]]|language=ko|last=Lee|first=Kwang-hyung|date=March 10, 2015|access-date=November 24, 2022|archive-date=November 24, 2022|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221124031046/http://news.kmib.co.kr/article/view.asp?arcid=0009220631&code=61181511&cp=nv|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=[UHD]씨스타 효린-소유, 상큼발랄한 매력이 담긴 겨울 화보 공개|trans-title=[UHD] Sistar's Hyorin and Soyou reveal their winter pictorial with their fresh and lively charms|url=https://www.topstarnews.net/news/articleView.html?idxno=82388|via=[[Naver]]|publisher=topstarnews.net|language=ko|last=Cho|first=Hye-jin|date=November 17, 2014|access-date=November 24, 2022|archive-date=November 24, 2022|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221124072355/https://www.topstarnews.net/news/articleView.html?idxno=82388|url-status=live}}</ref>

